{"id":90774426629843,"name":"Squid Game 2 🦑(Story)","desc":"Season 2 Update is here!\n\n🦑 Hey there! You've been hassled by a stranger to compete in mini games for money to cover your debt. Only one person can survive who will be the last one standing?\n\n🎁 Join 123! Studios group for free in-game Rewards! 🎁\n\n🔊 Play with the sound up for the best experience! 🔊\n\n💸 Unlock weapons and exclusive buffs with game passes!\n\n🛒 Struggling to survive? Check out the store for some helpful perks to help you survive! 🛒\n\n👍 If you enjoyed the game don't forget to like and favorite!\n⌛ Average Playing Time: 20 minutes\n\ntags: squid game, crab game, thanos, 456, mingle, dalgona","path":"/game/90774426629843-squid-game-2-story","slug":"90774426629843-squid-game-2-story","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/879df2095f8ada599d3272ff5e82eabfad77f1070051b882e9be6c33607d3295.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7cd667111f6d99d8a8f2449251a7e7ec/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":9770795,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-24T20:56:24.432Z","creator":{"name":"123! Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Squid-Game-2-(Story)-Infinite-cash-x-Anti-Doll-detection-Open-source-46107","_id":"68829df816be34bc8f071c62","title":"Infinite cash x Anti Doll detection Open source","game":{"_id":"68829df816be34bc8f071c5e","gameId":90774426629843,"name":"Squid Game 2 🦑(Story)","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":90774426629843},"features":"( YOUR EXECUTOR MUST SUPPORT HOOKMETAMETHOD, CHECK YOUR EXECUTORS UNC.\n\nthere's probably more that could've been done, but I died late game and didn't feel like starting over again so, this is all there is.\n\nthe scripts explain themselves, just run them once you've loaded in a game","tags":[],"script":"-- this one's the infinite cash\nfor i = 1,2000 do\ngame:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):WaitForChild(\"RemoteEvents\"):WaitForChild(\"RLGLPassed\"):FireServer()\nend\n\n-- this one turns off the red light green light detection\nlocal detecthook;\ndetecthook = hookmetamethod(game, \"__namecall\", function(self, ...)\n    local args = {...}\n    local method = getnamecallmethod()\n\n    if tostring(self) == \"PlayerTargetForElimination\" and method == \"FireServer\" then\n    return nil\nend\nreturn detecthook(self, unpack(args))\n\nend)\n\n-- this one just gives a badge\n\nlocal args = {\n\t4072071116660681\n}\ngame:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):WaitForChild(\"RemoteEvents\"):WaitForChild(\"GetBadge\"):FireServer(unpack(args))\n","owner":{"_id":"67fc036b69951090d880db5a","username":"mimarem","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/bfdbfccccc9ff4c574f1df49e0d5493cb61682b57aefe3c5bca075ade0f432fb.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67fc036b69951090d880db5a-1753387925794.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"67fc036b69951090d880db5a","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/bfdbfccccc9ff4c574f1df49e0d5493cb61682b57aefe3c5bca075ade0f432fb.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67fc036b69951090d880db5a-1753387925794.jpg"}},"verified":false,"views":4202,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/3103b6ee816be441de80d573b45eb01a3230c4d39c250910bd54a132e3cb1621.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/90774426629843-1753390584317.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/90774426629843-1753390584317.png"},"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-07-24T20:56:24.434Z","executes":85,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detecte